  ('daa539cc-3916-4ba0-8586-c826101c6598'::uuid, 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000306'::uuid, 'OH', 'medicaid_mco', '99343', 'covered', '{"answer":"Ohio Medicaid does not cover 99343 (home visit, new patient, moderate level). The \"MSRIAP schedule\" tab of Appendix DD carries it with status code 3 — discontinued coverage — and payment indicator D, which the schedule''s own key defines as DISCONTINUED PROCEDURE CODE, effective 01/01/2023. Its previous maximum payment was $76.55. This matches CPT, which deleted 99343 in the 2023 evaluation-and-management revision along with 99324-99328, 99334-99337 and 99339-99340. Bill 99342 or 99344 according to the level of service actually provided; Buckeye Health Plan will deny 99343 on the date of service regardless of documentation.","source":"Appendix DD to rule 5160-1-60 (Non-Institutional Fee Schedule), revised 01/01/2026, \"MSRIAP schedule\" tab","rateBasis":null,"stateFfsRate":null}'::jsonb, 'not_covered', 0.85, DATE '2023-01-01', NULL, 'c83c573f-ef17-4117-8ede-8e141a4b1431'::uuid, 'Appendix DD to rule 5160-1-60 (Non-Institutional Fee Schedule), revised 01/01/2026, "MSRIAP schedule" tab — 99343 | Home visit, new patient | 01/01/2023 | status 3 | payment D', 'extract:oh-appendixdd-mco4-2026-08'),
